WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.694 --> 00:00:06.110
MARK MIRCHANDANI:
In this episode,

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.500
we'll go over the 9th lab
and the baseline data, ML,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.020
and the AI quest on Qwiklabs.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.350
Cloud ML Engine, Qwik Start.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.070
Cloud ML Engine mainly
does two things.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.460
It enables you to train machine
learning models at scale

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.520
by running TensorFlow training
applications in the cloud.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.802
And it hosts those trained
models for you in the cloud

00:00:23.802 --> 00:00:26.260
so that you can use them to
get predictions about new data.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.420
This lab provides an
introductory walkthrough

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.060
of how to train a TensorFlow
model both locally

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.527
and on Cloud ML Engine.

00:00:32.527 --> 00:00:35.110
Then we'll learn how to deploy
your trained model in the Cloud

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:36.525
ML Engine for serving.

00:00:36.525 --> 00:00:38.400
You'll train your model
to predict the income

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.895
category of a person using the
United States census income

00:00:41.895 --> 00:00:43.330
data set.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.490
A basic familiarity with
Python and Linux commands

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:48.110
will be helpful for
this, but not necessary.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.690
Now, here's the
beauty of Qwiklabs.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.580
You'll get to work directly
with all of the resources

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:54.130
you need to learn these basic
skills in a real environment

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:56.476
without needing
an account on GCP.

00:00:56.476 --> 00:00:57.850
If you have an
idea and if you've

00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:59.500
wondered if GCP
is right for you,

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.039
you can start here with
little to no cost for you.

00:01:02.039 --> 00:01:03.580
Completing all the
labs in this quest

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.934
earns you this badge to
recognize your new skills.

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:08.350
You can show off your badge
on your resume or social media

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:09.580
channels.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:13.080
Next on our quest,
Data Studio Qwik Start.

